; Intro: room 0 until a key is pressed
;
; Called by the start of the game (#R$85FC) after ENTER in the title menu. Room 0 is the intro: the text "13th Century.
; The Cathars were being expelled ... The Cathar Jean Raymond runs to escape the crusaders..." with Jean and three
; crusaders walking across the screen (the four objects of kind 0 in the room object table, run by the game frame in
; the interrupt, #R$85E2). Jean's own state is set to 0 (none), so the player is not in play, and the key code
; #R$A2D2 is cleared. The routine enters room 0 (#R$86B9), draws it (#R$9B5A), sets the room state to $80, and runs the
; foreground half of the game frame in a loop: wait for a completed frame list (#R$8869), run it (#R$BDDA), build and
; copy the changed cells (#R$97B7, #R$95FF) and read the key code (#R$A304; the menu frame routine that does it in the
; menus is no longer installed). It returns when a key is down (#R$A2D2 is not 0), when the room state is 5 (R and Y
; were pressed together: the frame routine sets it, and the caller ignores it, as #R$BDF3 clears the state), or when any of the
; control bits 0-4 of #R$A2CF is set (right, left, crouch, jump, or the Kempston joystick).
; .
; Hardware: none directly; the screen is written by the routines called.
@label=RunIntro
c$8832 XOR A                ; PlayerState 0: no player in the intro
 $8833 LD ($A894),A
 $8836 LD ($8509),A         ; room 0
 $8839 LD ($A2D2),A         ; KeyCode: no key yet
 $883C CALL $86B9           ; build room 0
 $883F CALL $9B5A           ; draw it
@isub=LD A,STATE_RUNNING
 $8842 LD A,$80
 $8844 LD ($850C),A
@label=RunIntro_Loop
*$8847 CALL $8869           ; wait for a completed frame list
 $884A CALL $BDDA           ; = #R$BDDB, run the frame list
 $884D CALL $97B7           ; redraw runs and sprite jobs
 $8850 CALL $95FF           ; cells to the screen
 $8853 CALL $A304           ; KeyCode of the key held
 $8856 LD A,($A2D2)
 $8859 OR A
 $885A RET NZ               ; a key: the intro ends
 $885B LD A,($850C)
@isub=CP STATE_GAME_OVER
 $885E CP $05
 $8860 RET Z                ; R and Y: Game Over requested
 $8861 LD A,($A2CF)         ; ControlsRead
@isub=AND CTRL_MOVES
 $8864 AND $1F
 $8866 JR Z,$8847           ; no control pressed: go on
 $8868 RET
